   "answer": "The currently imported lecture does not contain any information about a \"local StudyGraph service,\" its response times, or P95 latency metrics.\n\nThe lecture material provided focuses on computer architecture and parallel computing, specifically covering:\n*   CPU multicore programming with pThreads (race conditions, critical sections) [S1, S3].\n*   CUDA thread indexing [S2].\n*   CPU instruction pipelines and out-of-order execution [S4, S5].\n*   Performance models (Speedup, Efficiency) [S6, S7].\n*   The evolution from CPU to GPU-centric systems for AI [S8].\n\nThere is no data regarding service-level objectives (SLOs), network latency, or specific application performance metrics for a \"StudyGraph service\" in the provided pages. Therefore, I cannot provide the P95 response time as the material is insufficient to answer this question.",
   "citations": [
