     "page": 56,
     "text": "                                                             };\n   ¡  Partition input into per-thread chunks.\n                                                                      pthread_create(&threads[tid], NULL,\n   ¡ Compute local partial sums independently.                         partial_sum, &tasks[tid]);\n                                                                    }\n   ¡  Join workers and reduce partial results.                                                                    double total = 0.0;\n                                                                    for (int tid = 0; tid < T; ++tid) {\n                                                                      pthread_join(threads[tid], NULL);\n                                                                      total += tasks[tid].partial;\n                                                                    }\n\n    ",
     "preview_url": "/api/documents/34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402/pages/56/preview",
     "source": "S3"
