     "page": 16,
     "text": "CPU: Optimize Latency of a Small Number of Complex Threads\n  Five-Stage Instruction Pipeline\n\n¡  Goal: Overlap time of data load/store\n\n¡  Fetch (IF)\n\n   ¡  Get instructions from instruction memory/cache\n\n¡ Decode (ID)\n\n   ¡  Resolve opcode and operands\n¡  Execute (EX)\n\n   ¡  ALU, vector unit, load/store unit, tensor core\n¡ Memory Access (MEM)\n\n   ¡  Load/store data through cache or memory hierarchy\n¡  Write Back (WB)\n\n   ¡  Update architectural state",
     "preview_url": "/api/documents/34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402/pages/16/preview",
